<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against both the dollar and the pound on Monday, commercial forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.0690 against the dollar from 19.9715 last Friday. The rupee traded at a mean of 33.7025 for one pound from 33.6925 on Friday.</p>
</text>
